    {
      "name": "Sanguine Curse",
      "category": "action",
      "placement": "actions",
      "activity": {
        "unit": "action",
        "number": 1,
        "symbol": null
      },
      "traits": [],
      "entries": [
        "The blood hag curses one creature she can see or sense within 60 feet of her. The target must succeed on a DC 17 Wisdom saving throw or be cursed for 1 minute. A creature automatically succeeds on this saving throw if it doesn't have blood. While cursed, the target is incapacitated and takes 9 (2d8) necrotic damage at the start of each of its turns as its internal blood vessels rupture. The cursed target can repeat the saving throw at the end of each of its turns, ending the curse on itself on a success."
      ],
